00:15:05.070 --> 00:15:05.570
Tanaka Ohmoto
(Mi)
Hasekura-senpai!

00:15:05.570 --> 00:15:05.700
Tanaka Ohmoto
(Mi)
Rei-sama!
Hasekura-senpai!

00:15:05.700 --> 00:15:06.130
Rei-sama!
Hasekura-senpai!

00:15:06.130 --> 00:15:06.600
Hasekura Aragaki
Rei-sama!
Hasekura-senpai!

00:15:06.600 --> 00:15:06.870
Hasekura Aragaki
Rosa Foetida!

00:15:06.870 --> 00:15:07.830
Rosa Foetida!

00:15:15.640 --> 00:15:16.040
Rei-sama!

00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:17.040
Go for it!
Rei-sama!

00:15:17.040 --> 00:15:17.270
Rei-sama!

00:15:23.280 --> 00:15:25.410
Rei-chan, go for it!

00:15:25.620 --> 00:15:28.320
Don't lose to that Tanaka-san!

00:15:34.800 --> 00:15:36.520
Head!

00:15:37.300 --> 00:15:38.090
End of match!

00:15:39.570 --> 00:15:41.430
Lillian! Hasekura!

00:15:45.470 --> 00:15:47.340
Ohnaka
Girls'
Lillian
Girls'
Academy

00:15:48.240 --> 00:15:50.140
The final outcome was unfortunate,

00:15:50.440 --> 00:15:53.710
but with this loss today,
we'll become stronger tomorrow.

00:15:54.350 --> 00:15:55.210
Yes, ma'am.
Yes, ma'am.

00:16:00.890 --> 00:16:01.480
Oh!

00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:03.380
Shoot!

00:16:03.890 --> 00:16:04.860
See you later!

00:16:05.590 --> 00:16:06.350
Yoshino?

00:16:06.590 --> 00:16:08.420
Sorry! Please, just let it go!

00:16:13.930 --> 00:16:15.030
Crap!

00:16:18.770 --> 00:16:19.760
Yoshino-chan!

00:16:23.880 --> 00:16:25.670
What are you in such a hurry for?

00:16:28.880 --> 00:16:30.920
Don't tell me you couldn't
find a little sister...

00:16:30.920 --> 00:16:34.180
...and that's why you're running from me.

00:16:35.660 --> 00:16:39.460
My, is that how poorly you think of me?

00:16:40.030 --> 00:16:42.190
Then you have a little sister?

00:16:42.630 --> 00:16:44.190
O-Of course.

00:16:44.260 --> 00:16:47.830
Did you give her the rosary
that Rei gave you?

00:16:47.900 --> 00:16:48.600
Yes.

00:16:48.700 --> 00:16:49.930
That's strange.

00:16:51.140 --> 00:16:52.940
Isn't that the rosary?

00:16:53.570 --> 00:16:55.740
Yes, it's the rosary.

00:16:55.740 --> 00:16:58.850
I actually wanted to do it
in front of you, Eriko-sama,

00:16:58.850 --> 00:17:00.650
so I have yet to give it to her.

00:17:00.650 --> 00:17:01.410
My!

00:17:01.920 --> 00:17:04.180
So, where is this little sister in question?

00:17:04.690 --> 00:17:06.410
My little sister is...

00:17:10.860 --> 00:17:12.930
My little sister is in
the washroom right now.

00:17:12.930 --> 00:17:14.420
I'll go check on her!

00:17:15.100 --> 00:17:16.150
Yoshino-chan?

00:17:16.560 --> 00:17:18.430
I'll run into one of the bathroom stalls!

00:17:18.770 --> 00:17:20.600
Hold on, Yoshino-chan!

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:29.810
Ow, that hurt...

00:17:29.980 --> 00:17:31.340
Are you all right?

00:17:39.120 --> 00:17:40.350
I-I'm okay.

00:17:43.490 --> 00:17:45.390
What a pretty rosary.

00:17:45.890 --> 00:17:47.260
This girl...

00:17:48.230 --> 00:17:50.030
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:17:50.030 --> 00:17:51.290
I'll return it to you.

00:17:56.570 --> 00:17:58.440
Don't tell me... it's her?

00:18:01.280 --> 00:18:03.140
I'm in luck! She's from Lillian!

00:18:03.840 --> 00:18:05.210
Play along.

00:18:05.210 --> 00:18:05.740
What?

00:18:06.580 --> 00:18:08.170
Allow me to introduce you.

00:18:08.620 --> 00:18:12.350
She is the one I would like
to make my little sister.

00:18:13.220 --> 00:18:15.120
M-My name is Nana Arima.

00:18:15.460 --> 00:18:16.510
Nice to meet you.

00:18:17.220 --> 00:18:18.890
Hmm, I see.

00:18:19.030 --> 00:18:20.320
Nana-chan, is it?

00:18:20.460 --> 00:18:21.690
I'll remember that.

00:18:22.360 --> 00:18:25.490
Weren't you going to perform
the ceremony in front of me?

00:18:25.770 --> 00:18:27.940
Oh, we'll get to that some other time...

00:18:27.940 --> 00:18:28.800
Why?

00:18:29.100 --> 00:18:30.440
We're all here already.

00:18:30.440 --> 00:18:31.870
Let's just get it over with.

00:18:33.510 --> 00:18:36.070
There are various circumstances...

00:18:36.180 --> 00:18:37.340
What kinds of circumstances?

00:18:37.880 --> 00:18:39.000
Well...

00:18:39.750 --> 00:18:41.180
I am so very sorry.

00:18:41.450 --> 00:18:43.380
The circumstance has to do with me...

00:18:43.380 --> 00:18:46.750
...and I am unable to accept the
rosary right away because of it.

00:18:52.860 --> 00:18:54.230
Well, I suppose that's fine.

00:18:55.300 --> 00:18:59.400
Yoshino-chan, as a reward for
introducing me to your little sister,

00:18:59.400 --> 00:19:01.260
I'll leave you alone for a while.

00:19:02.270 --> 00:19:03.530
Good day.

00:19:04.270 --> 00:19:05.910
You needn't say that.

00:19:05.910 --> 00:19:08.000
Please come visit whenever you like.

00:19:08.340 --> 00:19:09.210
Oh, yes.

00:19:09.480 --> 00:19:10.240
Nana-chan.

00:19:11.550 --> 00:19:13.480
Be sure to keep your appearance neat.

00:19:13.710 --> 00:19:16.050
Make sure you fix that under your sweatshirt.

00:19:16.050 --> 00:19:17.020
Yes, ma'am.

00:19:20.550 --> 00:19:22.850
Thank you. You saved me.

00:19:22.960 --> 00:19:26.020
But she saw right through it.

00:19:26.230 --> 00:19:26.750
What?

00:19:29.700 --> 00:19:30.630
You're...

00:19:31.670 --> 00:19:33.570
...a middle school student?!

00:19:33.670 --> 00:19:35.600
Yes, I'm a third-year.

00:19:36.170 --> 00:19:38.330
Eriko-sama noticed that?

00:19:38.440 --> 00:19:39.000
Yes.

00:19:47.780 --> 00:19:50.220
The little sister of Hasekura Rei-sama...

00:19:52.390 --> 00:19:56.520
Will your little sister get to receive that rosary?

00:19:57.360 --> 00:19:58.020
What?

00:20:11.740 --> 00:20:14.370
Nana... Arima...

00:20:19.680 --> 00:20:20.870
Listen to this, Yumi-san!

00:20:21.350 --> 00:20:24.250
It turns out Nana Arima is
Tanaka-san's little sister!

00:20:24.750 --> 00:20:26.690
Nana Arima?

00:20:26.820 --> 00:20:30.920
Oh, the middle school student
you introduced to Eriko-sama?

00:20:30.990 --> 00:20:32.630
Tanaka-san from what class?

00:20:32.630 --> 00:20:34.660
No! Not from Lillian!

00:20:34.660 --> 00:20:36.360
Tanaka-san of Ohnaka Girls'!

00:20:36.360 --> 00:20:38.260
She's the youngest!

00:20:38.530 --> 00:20:40.430
But her name is Arima, right?

00:20:40.570 --> 00:20:44.140
Her grandfather's last name
is Arima and he adopted her.

00:20:44.140 --> 00:20:47.700
And she enrolled at Lillian
per her grandfather's wishes.

00:20:47.840 --> 00:20:49.930
You certainly found out a lot over the weekend.

00:20:51.950 --> 00:20:55.180
Seriously, she's got way
too many "circumstances."

00:20:57.480 --> 00:20:58.820
Oh, Mami-san...

00:21:00.020 --> 00:21:03.080
That reminds me, I heard that
those two became soeurs?

00:21:03.190 --> 00:21:03.660
What?

00:21:04.320 --> 00:21:06.460
They're both with the school paper...

00:21:06.460 --> 00:21:09.090
...and it seems it was the tea
party that got them together.

00:21:12.100 --> 00:21:13.030
Yumi-san.

00:21:14.700 --> 00:21:19.210
If I still don't have a little sister by
the time I become a third-year,

00:21:19.210 --> 00:21:22.180
I'm making Nana Arima my little sister.

00:21:22.280 --> 00:21:22.770
What?

00:21:25.110 --> 00:21:27.440
That is what Yoshino-san said.

00:21:28.220 --> 00:21:29.220
And?

00:21:29.220 --> 00:21:31.810
I've been backed even further into a corner.

00:21:32.590 --> 00:21:33.810
So it would seem.

00:21:34.550 --> 00:21:36.680
You know, Onee-sama,

00:21:37.020 --> 00:21:40.050
I am glad now that we held the tea party.

00:21:40.590 --> 00:21:43.590
Even though you were unable
to find a little sister?

00:21:43.730 --> 00:21:44.490
Yes.

00:21:44.770 --> 00:21:47.170
Even so, compared to before the tea party,

00:21:47.170 --> 00:21:50.570
I have come to think far more seriously
about having a little sister.

00:21:51.070 --> 00:21:53.200
Oh? In what way?

00:21:53.470 --> 00:21:56.070
It's nothing complicated.

00:21:56.410 --> 00:21:59.310
I just hope that I will meet someone,

00:21:59.310 --> 00:22:02.540
with whom I can feel that we can
love each other with all our hearts.

00:22:02.750 --> 00:22:04.010
Yes.

00:22:04.320 --> 00:22:06.590
That is a truly simple thing,

00:22:06.590 --> 00:22:08.490
and yet more difficult than you would think,

00:22:08.490 --> 00:22:11.050
and also the most important thing.

00:22:15.330 --> 00:22:16.300
Yumi.

00:22:17.760 --> 00:22:21.230
Just as we love each other very much,

00:22:21.230 --> 00:22:24.670
find a little sister whom you
can feel the same way about.

00:22:26.340 --> 00:22:27.070
I will!

00:22:44.790 --> 00:22:47.860
A winterscape where even...
Machi no irodori sae doko

00:22:47.860 --> 00:22:52.420
...the town's colors seem forlorn somehow
to naku samishige na fuyu no keshiki

00:22:52.800 --> 00:22:56.600
I think of you, turning your back on me...
Senaka mise kaketeitta

00:22:56.600 --> 00:23:00.330
...and running off
anata o omou

00:23:01.310 --> 00:23:05.350
There's a clear square pane...
Futari no aida ni wa

00:23:05.350 --> 00:23:09.350
...between the two of us
toumei na shikakkei

00:23:09.350 --> 00:23:12.090
It's misted over right now...
Ima wa kasunderu

00:23:12.090 --> 00:23:18.680
...with the crystals of sighs
tame-iki no kesshou de

00:23:19.290 --> 00:23:23.360
Window glass, window glass
Mado garasu mado garasu

00:23:23.360 --> 00:23:29.300
It's clouded and I can't see you
Kumottete anata ga mienai no

00:23:29.300 --> 00:23:35.210
Even though I know that you're there
Soko ni iru koto wa wakatteiru no ni

00:23:35.340 --> 00:23:39.250
Are you smiling? Are you crying?
Waratteru naiteru no

00:23:39.250 --> 00:23:45.150
I don't even care if you're frowning, let me see you
Shikamettsura demo ii kara misete

00:23:45.250 --> 00:23:53.720
Wipe the glass from your side, too
Sochira no hou kara mo garasu o fuite

00:24:06.010 --> 00:24:06.940
Preview

00:24:06.940 --> 00:24:08.580
Preview
During exam break,

00:24:08.580 --> 00:24:10.910
Preview
it seems Yumi-san went to the
amusement park with Sachiko-sama.

00:24:10.910 --> 00:24:12.580
Preview
A lot of things apparently happened there,

00:24:12.580 --> 00:24:15.480
Preview
but an incident also came up
for me just a bit before that.

00:24:15.480 --> 00:24:18.420
Preview
I heard Rei-chan was attending
a match-making meeting.

00:24:18.420 --> 00:24:22.360
Preview
But I had promised to meet with
Arima Nana-san on the same day,

00:24:22.360 --> 00:24:24.060
Preview
so we went spying together.

00:24:24.060 --> 00:24:26.460
Preview
Learning that Rei-chan's match
was with a 10-year-old boy,

00:24:26.460 --> 00:24:27.930
Preview
I breathed a sigh of relief.
